# The stamp beside this file is md5(package.json) exactly as the file sits on
# disk: wails compares the two to decide whether the frontend dependencies need
# reinstalling, and the version test asserts they agree.
#
# A checkout that rewrites the line endings breaks both — and a Windows checkout
# did, because Git for Windows converts text files by default. npm writes this
# file with LF, so that is what is kept everywhere.
frontend/package.json text eol=lf

# A bare hash, not text: never converted.
frontend/package.json.md5 -text
